[32m+[m[32m## Cross-Validation Folds & Comparability[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Patient-Grouped Folds (Default)[m
[32m+[m[32mBy default, `ml/scripts/train_3d.py` assigns cross-validation folds grouped strictly by `patient_id` (read from the de-identified `worklist.csv`):[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **Patient Grouping**: All scans of the same patient are grouped together. Paired scans never straddle train and validation splits.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **Deterministic Shuffling**: Sorted unique patient IDs are deterministically shuffled using `SEED=42`. Directory discovery order and case renaming do not alter fold assignment.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. **Balanced Allocation**: Patient groups are assigned via greedy bin-packing to the currently smallest fold (ties broken by lowest fold index). Fold sizes remain balanced within ±1 case.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. **Fail-Closed Privacy**: If `patient_id` is missing or blank for any case in `worklist.csv`, execution halts with a clear error unless `--allow-case-level-folds` is explicitly specified.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Reproducing Legacy Runs (`--legacy-case-folds`)[m
[32m+[m[32mEarlier versions assigned folds at the case level via round-robin (`groups[i % folds_n].append(case)` on sorted case IDs), which could allow multi-scan patients to straddle fold boundaries.[m
[32m+[m[32mTo reproduce those historical assignments bit-for-bit:[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32mpython ml/scripts/train_3d.py <base> --legacy-case-folds[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Why Old and New Runs Are NOT Comparable[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **Holdout Independence**: Legacy runs used scan-level holdouts where paired scans of the same patient could appear in both train and validation sets. Patient-grouped runs enforce strict patient-level holdouts, preventing multi-scan leakage.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **Dataset Fingerprint Isolation**: Checkpoints and metrics embed a SHA-256 dataset fingerprint and `fold_mode` ("patient_grouped" vs "legacy_case_level"). Auto-resume (`--resume`) and completed fold skipping (`--skip-completed`) detect mismatches and refuse to merge or resume across different fold modes.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. **Sampling Mix Isolation**: Patch sampling mix (`--sampling-mix lesion=A,bone=B,random=C`) is recorded in `data_config` and the fingerprint. Non-default sampling requires an isolated `--out-dir` outside `data/`.[m
